                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dce6e5ca-a226-479a-9a8f-3d82a987b964",
                        "entry_id": "fe66a679-a8ff-34ac-9811-4a1edc0c512d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "breadlines"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd1799d0-c48e-3c17-bd89-d0140a4ab14b",
                        "entry_id": "fe66a679-a8ff-34ac-9811-4a1edc0c512d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A line of people waiting to receive food from a charity."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfae7853-3a09-4b5f-aad8-2da827a0fadb",
                                "sense_id": "cd1799d0-c48e-3c17-bd89-d0140a4ab14b",
                                "text": "I do not think anyone of us can walk by a breadline and see even the most unkempt and raggedy man in the line without saying to himself, \"There but for the grace of God.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dde2fb8b-5ea5-4226-81f9-d7649621d2e0",
                                "sense_id": "cd1799d0-c48e-3c17-bd89-d0140a4ab14b",
                                "text": "Breadlines and social agencies, while staffing women, employed more men and served more men, making women a minority in the visual landscape."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                        "entry_id": "fe66a679-a8ff-34ac-9811-4a1edc0c512d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The lowest income level at which one's most basic necessities of survival are met; poverty line or subsistence level."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b7345b9-1103-4799-a605-b941640236b1",
                                "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                                "text": "Every day brings new worries about falling below the breadline."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b16984fb-c562-4b7f-88dd-6421c36a58d8",
                                "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                                "text": "[…] and she wasn't used to cash, living on the breadline with a kid to bring up."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d77ee09-fe86-4dd0-8731-7211fb6ea143",
                                "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                                "text": "It hurt him to see other good ex-servicemen working their socks off and making no-gooders comfortable while they remained just over the breadline."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6e6beb6-20ba-4825-abdd-26ac11156426",
                                "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                                "text": "It changed her. Having lived below the breadline, having lived with excess, was it about to change once more?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bd8eaff-db72-4120-917b-d3500ae4353e",
                                "sense_id": "0ac2d927-65d0-31ea-9c1f-296cc1a17530",
                                "text": "For poor people that takes them near the breadline, but they still do it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e539f2d3-5ce3-472d-ab70-c576226e6f65",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe66a679-a8ff-34ac-9811-4a1edc0c512d",
                        "source_sense_description": "line for food from charity",
                        "target_lang_word": "Brotschlange",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0169e227-cdc3-4e0e-8bf8-a13ae2775ff5",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe66a679-a8ff-34ac-9811-4a1edc0c512d",
                        "source_sense_description": "subsistence level",
                        "target_lang_word": "Existenzminimum",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Existenzminimum",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcc61898-ab79-3c6c-8c80-d3669521f57e",
                                        "entry_id": "ae09b9fc-a9bd-39ee-93c0-cb4623274ae3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ausmaß der materiellen Mittel, die mindestens notwendig sind, um den Lebensunterhalt zu bestreiten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cd57c98-d44b-4af9-b01f-975804529702",
                                                "sense_id": "dcc61898-ab79-3c6c-8c80-d3669521f57e",
                                                "text": "„Berücksichtigt werden nicht nur das sächliche Existenzminimum gem. § 32 Abs. 6 Satz 1, 1. Tatbestand EStG (Kinderfreibetrag), sondern auch der Ausbildungs- und Erziehungsbedarf des Kindes (§ 32 Abs. 6 Satz 1, 2. Tatbestand EStG) und beides in entsprechender Größenordnung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b55e666f-142e-4e22-b8be-f634f3ad1681",
                                                "sense_id": "dcc61898-ab79-3c6c-8c80-d3669521f57e",
                                                "text": "„Gegenstand der Existenzminimumberichte ist die Darstellung der maßgebenden Beträge für die Bemessung der steuerfrei zu stellenden Existenzminima von Erwachsenen und Kindern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc869fbb-226b-4ed0-b25d-aebc274bb3ef",
                                                "sense_id": "dcc61898-ab79-3c6c-8c80-d3669521f57e",
                                                "text": "„Die Arbeitsbedingungen in den Salpetergruben waren schrecklich, die Angestellten mussten pro Tag 16 Stunden arbeiten und erhielten dafür einen Lohn, der gerade mal dem Existenzminimum entsprach.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ea4ccf8-0ec9-44a7-9f5f-08319ab0d572",
                                                "sense_id": "dcc61898-ab79-3c6c-8c80-d3669521f57e",
                                                "text": "„Solche Einwände gelten ja als zu persönlich und geschmacklos, aber das Geschmacklose liegt darin, daß so einer anderen ihr Existenzminimum vorrechnet.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
